{
 "duration": 77.400816,
 "frames": 2322,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Medicine's greatest discovery happened because a scientist didn't wash his dishes.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.023
  },
  {
   "text": "London,",
   "start": 5.639,
   "end": 6.124
  },
  {
   "text": "nineteen twenty-eight.",
   "start": 6.422,
   "end": 7.531
  },
  {
   "text": "Alexander Fleming was brilliant,",
   "start": 8.095,
   "end": 10.209
  },
  {
   "text": "and his lab bench was a disaster.",
   "start": 10.512,
   "end": 12.875
  },
  {
   "text": "Dishes of bacteria were stacked everywhere,",
   "start": 13.366,
   "end": 15.913
  },
  {
   "text": "some old enough to need their own name.",
   "start": 16.163,
   "end": 18.02
  },
  {
   "text": "That summer,",
   "start": 18.524,
   "end": 19.2
  },
  {
   "text": "he went on holiday and left the whole pile behind.",
   "start": 19.2,
   "end": 22.13
  },
  {
   "text": "When he came back,",
   "start": 22.648,
   "end": 23.509
  },
  {
   "text": "one dish had grown a fuzzy blue-green mould.",
   "start": 23.72,
   "end": 26.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Gross,",
   "start": 26.776,
   "end": 27.106
  },
  {
   "text": "but normal.",
   "start": 27.106,
   "end": 28.096
  },
  {
   "text": "Except around the mould,",
   "start": 28.609,
   "end": 30.587
  },
  {
   "text": "the bacteria were gone.",
   "start": 30.776,
   "end": 32.196
  },
  {
   "text": "Not dying.",
   "start": 32.662,
   "end": 33.364
  },
  {
   "text": "Gone.",
   "start": 33.832,
   "end": 34.313
  },
  {
   "text": "Like someone had drawn a circle and said,",
   "start": 34.779,
   "end": 36.627
  },
  {
   "text": "keep out.",
   "start": 36.823,
   "end": 37.453
  },
  {
   "text": "Fleming grew more of the mould and tested its juice.",
   "start": 37.944,
   "end": 40.751
  },
  {
   "text": "It wiped out germs that killed people every day.",
   "start": 41.196,
   "end": 44.136
  },
  {
   "text": "But here's the catch.",
   "start": 44.598,
   "end": 45.775
  },
  {
   "text": "He couldn't make enough of it,",
   "start": 46.119,
   "end": 47.467
  },
  {
   "text": "and almost nobody cared.",
   "start": 47.721,
   "end": 49.499
  },
  {
   "text": "For ten years,",
   "start": 49.922,
   "end": 50.803
  },
  {
   "text": "the miracle sat on a shelf.",
   "start": 50.803,
   "end": 52.859
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a team in Oxford figured out how to brew it by the bucket.",
   "start": 53.288,
   "end": 56.668
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon factories were making millions of doses,",
   "start": 57.075,
   "end": 59.836
  },
  {
   "text": "and simple scratches stopped being deadly.",
   "start": 60.02,
   "end": 62.43
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "start": 62.881,
   "end": 63.341
  },
  {
   "text": "the mould probably drifted in from a lab downstairs.",
   "start": 63.341,
   "end": 66.327
  },
  {
   "text": "Fleming's real genius?",
   "start": 66.766,
   "end": 67.994
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked before he scrubbed.",
   "start": 68.391,
   "end": 70.071
  },
  {
   "text": "He won a Nobel Prize.",
   "start": 70.465,
   "end": 71.44
  },
  {
   "text": "And to this day,",
   "start": 71.44,
   "end": 72.09
  },
  {
   "text": "the most important dish in history is the one he forgot to wash.",
   "start": 72.482,
   "end": 77.401
  }
 ]
}